zes US driver license using regex.", "displayName": "Us License Recognizer", "exceptionList": [], "isSystemDefault": true, "recognizerConfig": {"name": "UsLicenseRecognizer", "type": "predefined", "supportedLanguage": "en"}, "confidenceThreshold": 0.6}, {"id": "c455ef7d-1741-494c-9c75-dec4068d0f4d", "name": "UsItinRecognizer", "target": "content", "enabled": true, "version": 0.1, "description": "Recognizes US ITIN (Individual Taxpayer Identification Number) using regex.", "displayName": "Us Itin Recognizer", "exceptionList": [], "isSystemDefault": true, "recognizerConfig": {"name": "UsItinRecognizer", "type": "predefined", "supportedLanguage": "en"}, "confidenceThreshold": 0.6}, {"id": "55620ba0-0450-486d-a6a7-f7a62b4aa08d", "name": "UsPassportRecognizer", "target": "content", "enabled": true, "version": 0.1, "description": "Recognizes US Passport number using regex.", "displayName": "Us Passport Recognizer", "exceptionList": [], "isSystemDefault": true, "recognizerConfig": {"name": "UsPassportRecognizer", "type": "predefined", "supportedLanguage": "en"}, "confidenceThreshold": 0.6}, {"id": "cb4b6bad-8ba2-44d8-b85c-d23b2ce6fc91", "name": "UsSsnRecognizer", "target": "content", "enabled": true, "version": 0.1, "description": "Recognize US Social Security Number (SSN) using regex.", "displayName": "Us Ssn Recognizer", "exceptionList": [], "isSystemDefault": true, "recognizerConfig": {"name": "UsSsnRecognizer", "type": "predefined", "context": ["social", "security", "ssn", "ssns", "ssid", "national_id", "id_number"], "supportedLanguage": "en"}, "confidenceThreshold": 0.6}, {"id": "03442554-3a22-4db3-8ff6-cfa57c785ec1", "name": "NhsRecognizer", "target": "content", "enabled": true, "version": 0.1, "description": "Recognizes NHS number using regex and checksum.", "displayName": "Nhs Recognizer", "exceptionList": [], "isSystemDefault": true, "recognizerConfig": {"name": "NhsRecognizer", "type": "predefined", "context": ["nhs", "national_health_service", "nhs_number"], "supportedLanguage": "en"}, "confidenceThreshold": 0.6}, {"id": "0943386d-3b8a-4621-8dbe-61b31bce01e7", "name": "UkNinoRecognizer", "target": "content", "enabled": true, "version": 0.1, "description": "Recognizes UK National Insurance Number using regex.", "displayName": "Uk Nino Recognizer", "exceptionList": [], "isSystemDefault": true, "recognizerConfig": {"name": "UkNinoRecognizer", "type": "predefined", "supportedLanguage": "en"}, "confidenceThreshold": 0.6}, {"id": "e82131b4-e012-49ee-9aa5-9b8d69571919", "name": "SgFinRecognizer", "target": "content", "enabled": true, "version": 0.1, "description": "Recognize SG FIN/NRIC number using regex.", "displayName": "Sg Fin Recognizer", "exceptionList": [], "isSystemDefault": true, "recognizerConfig": {"name": "SgFinRecognizer", "type": "predefined", "supportedLanguage": "en"}, "confidenceThreshold": 0.6}, {"id": "475d6bd4-9062-461a-ae66-fc6af6b35f5e", "name": "AuAbnRecognizer", "target": "content", "enabled": true, "version": 0.1, "description": "Recognizes Australian Business Number (\\"ABN\\").<br/><br/>The Australian Business Number (ABN) is a unique 11 digit identifier issued to all entities registered in the Australian Business Register (ABR). The 11 digit ABN is structured as a 9 digit identifier<br/><br/>with two leading check digits.<br/><br/>The leading check digits are derived using a modulus 89 calculation.<br/><br/>This recognizer identifies ABN using regex, context words and checksum.<br/><br/>Reference: https://abr.business.gov.au/Help/AbnFormat", "displayName": "Au Abn Recognizer", "exceptionList": [], "isSystemDefault": true, "recognizerConfig": {"name": "AuAbnRecognizer", "type": "predefined", "supportedLanguage": "en"}, "confidenceThreshold": 0.6}, {"id": "0cb8c7a1-4b69-4565-865c-b855c049b705", "name": "AuAcnRecognizer", "target": "content", "enabled": true, "version": 0.1, "description": "Recognizes Australian Company Number (\\"ACN\\").<br/><br/>The Australian Company Number (ACN) is a nine digit number with the last digit being a check digit calculated using a modified modulus 10 calculation.<br/><br/>This recognizer identifies ACN using regex, context words, and checksum.<br/><br/>Reference: https://asic.gov.au/", "displayName": "Au Acn Recognizer", "exceptionList": [], "isSystemDefault": true, "recognizerConfig": {"name": "AuAcnRecognizer", "type": "predefined", "supportedLanguage": "en"}, "confidenceThreshold": 0.6}, {"id": "1ee02853-6c17-4067-9c33-e131cdf641f7", "name": "AuTfnRecognizer", "target": "content", "enabled": true, "version": 0.1, "description": "Recognizes Australian Tax File Numbers (\\"TFN\\").<br/><br/>The tax file number (TFN) is a unique identifier issued by the Australian Taxation Office to each taxpaying entity \\\\u2014 an individual, company,<br/><br/>superannuation fund, partnership, or trust.<br/><br/>The TFN consists of a nine digit number, usually presented in the format NNN NNN NNN.<br/><br/>TFN includes a check digit for detecting erroneous number based on simple modulo 11.<br/><br/>This recognizer uses regex, context words,<br/><br/>and checksum to identify TFN.<br/><br/>Reference: https://www.ato.gov.au/individuals/tax-file-number/", "displayName": "Au Tfn Recognizer", "exceptionList": [], "isSystemDefault": true, "recognizerConfig": {"name": "AuTfnRecognizer", "type": "predefined", "supportedLanguage": "en"}, "confidenceThreshold": 0.6}, {"id": "4ea667c4-488c-451b-9380-7137019ce92b", "name": "AuMedicareRecognizer", "target": "content", "enabled": true, "version": 0.1, "description": "Recognizes Australian Medicare number using regex, context words, and checksum.<br/><br/>Medicare number is a unique identifier issued by Australian Government that enables the cardholder to receive a rebates of medical expenses under Australia's Medicare system.<br/><br/>It uses a modulus 10 checksum scheme to validate the number.<br/><br/>Reference: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Medicare_card_(Australia)", "displayName": "Au Medicare Recognizer", "exceptionList": [], "isSystemDefault": true, "recognizerConfig": {"name": "AuMedicareRecognizer", "type": "predefined", "supportedLanguage": "en"}, "confidenceThreshold": 0.6}, {"id": "c1f8def4-9e4f-415a-ad80-dc94b3d7ead0", "name": "InPanRecognizer", "target": "content", "enabled": true, "version": 0.1, "description": "Recognizes Indian Permanent Account Number (\\"PAN\\").<br/><br/>The Permanent Account Number (PAN) is a ten digit alpha-numeric code with the last digit being a check digit calculated using a modified modulus 10 calculation.<br/><br/>This recognizer identifies PAN using regex and context words.<br/><br/>Reference: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Permanent_account_number\\nhttps://incometaxindia.gov.in/Forms/tps/1.Permanent%20Account%20Number%20(PAN).pdf", "displayName": "In Pan Recognizer", "exceptionList": [], "isSystemDefault": true, "recognizerConfig": {"name": "InPanRecognizer", "type": "predefined", "supportedLanguage": "en"}, "confidenceThreshold": 0.6}, {"id": "2e5a8bc5-e646-4292-9301-8d1991a32deb", "name": "InAadhaarRecognizer", "target": "content", "enabled": true, "version": 0.1, "description": "Recognizes Indian UIDAI Person Identification Number (\\"AADHAAR\\").<br/><br/>Reference: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aadhaar<br/><br/>A 12 digit unique number that is issued to each individual by Government of India", "displayName": "In Aadhaar Recognizer", "exceptionList": [], "isSystemDefault": true, "recognizerConfig": {"name": "InAadhaarRecognizer", "type": "predefined", "supportedLanguage": "en"}, "confidenceThreshold": 0.6}, {"id": "1dd833cb-e069-4197-883f-910566456fb0", "name": "InVehicleRegistrationRecognizer", "target": "content", "enabled": true, "version": 0.1, "description": "Recognizes Indian Vehicle Registration Number issued by RTO.<br/><br/>Reference(s):<br/><br/>https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vehicle_registration_plates_of_India\\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Regional_Transport_Office\\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Regional_Transport_Office_districts_in_India<br/><br/>The registration scheme changed over time with multiple formats in play over the years<br/><br/>India has multiple active patterns for registration plates issued to different vehicle categories", "displayName": "In Vehicle Registration Recognizer", "exceptionList": [], "isSystemDefault": true, "recognizerConfig": {"name": "InVehicleRegistrationRecognizer", "type": "predefined", "supportedLanguage": "en"}, "confidenceThreshold": 0.6}, {"id": "73336e9c-2b68-4282-9b47-7a0b53198f97", "name": "InPassportRecognizer", "target": "content", "enabled": true, "version": 0.1, "description": "Recognizes Indian Passport Number.<br/><br/>Indian Passport Number is a eight digit alphanumeric number.<br/><br/>Reference:<br/><br/>https://www.bajajallianz.com/blog/travel-insurance-articles/where-is-passport-number-in-indian-passport.html", "displayName": "In Passport Recognizer", "exceptionList": [], "isSystemDefault": true, "recognizerConfig": {"name": "InPassportRecognizer", "type": "predefined", "supportedLanguage": "en"}, "confidenceThreshold": 0.6}, {"id": "b697b743-8083-440b-9c5b-81ca1adc0060", "name": "EsNifRecognizer", "target": "content", "enabled": true, "version": 0.1, "description": "Recognize NIF number using regex and checksum.", "displayName": "Es Nif Recognizer", "exceptionList": [], "isSystemDefault": true, "recognizerConfig": {"name": "EsNifRecognizer", "type": "predefined", "supportedLanguage": "es"}, "confidenceThreshold": 0.6}, {"id": "0bc34ca8-7845-4830-9b82-723f4508e68c", "name": "EsNieRecognizer", "target": "content", "enabled": true, "version": 0.1, "description": "Recognize NIE number using regex and checksum.<br/><br/>Reference(s):<br/><br/>https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/N%C3%BAmero_de_identidad_de_extranjero\\nhttps://www.interior.gob.es/opencms/ca/servicios-al-ciudadano/tramites-y-gestiones/dni/calculo-del-digito-de-control-del-nif-nie/", "displayName": "Es Nie Recognizer", "exceptionList": [], "isSystemDefault